  "description": "Pure, BCL-only transport vocabulary for the FS.GG.Net component — the two-tier seam (ITransport byte-message duplex, IMessageChannel typed protobuf request/response), the ConnectionState lifecycle, and a pluggable Correlation strategy (Sequential id-verified for StarCraft II; Multiplexed for pipelined protocols). Knows no .proto and no game types. ADR-0052.",
